    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678940/extras/7d96d3ffd9f119b8a0f4d0a88d9b4717.avif?t=1695398604\" /></div><br>Join NEG and Buddy on an unforgettable quest to restore harmony and save Neglandia from darkness. Are you ready to embark on this thrilling journey? <br>Wishlist now and be the hero Neglandia needs!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678940/extras/38ddc091bf5fbdafdc9b1c6f17180c9c.avif?t=1695398604\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Original Soundtrack:</strong> Embark on your adventure with an enchanting original musical score, meticulously composed to resonate with the heart of the journey.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678940/extras/cd8a192b401550dc068a4e2aca856e25.poster.avif?t=1695398604\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678940/extras/cd8a192b401550dc068a4e2aca856e25.webm?t=1695398604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678940/extras/cd8a192b401550dc068a4e2aca856e25.mp4?t=1695398604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li> <strong>Dynamic Platforming: </strong> Master the art of precise platforming as you navigate through an array of challenging levels, harnessing NEG's unique abilities to overcome obstacles.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678940/extras/44fe2687c02a5e8e04f137ab69c836a2.poster.avif?t=1695398604\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678940/extras/44fe2687c02a5e8e04f137ab69c836a2.webm?t=1695398604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678940/extras/44fe2687c02a5e8e04f137ab69c836a2.mp4?t=1695398604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li> <strong>Feather Collection:</strong> Gather sacred feathers to reveal hidden paths and uncover secrets within the vibrant world of Neglandia.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678940/extras/06aede498d8d4d744550bada7f4c0182.poster.avif?t=1695398604\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678940/extras/06aede498d8d4d744550bada7f4c0182.webm?t=1695398604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678940/extras/06aede498d8d4d744550bada7f4c0182.mp4?t=1695398604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li> <strong>Original Pixel Art and Smooth Animations:</strong> Immerse yourself in the visually captivating world of Neglandia, characterized by meticulously crafted pixel art and seamlessly fluid animations.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678940/extras/c93ee0b0560a92b1850f37114378ab84.poster.avif?t=1695398604\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678940/extras/c93ee0b0560a92b1850f37114378ab84.webm?t=1695398604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678940/extras/c93ee0b0560a92b1850f37114378ab84.mp4?t=1695398604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li> <strong>Epic Boss Battles:</strong> Test your mettle against formidable bosses, employing strategic tactics to unveil their vulnerabilities and emerge victorious.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678940/extras/fbd9ad89b9056a9a1f218b475817f617.poster.avif?t=1695398604\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678940/extras/fbd9ad89b9056a9a1f218b475817f617.webm?t=1695398604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678940/extras/fbd9ad89b9056a9a1f218b475817f617.mp4?t=1695398604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li> <strong>Exploration and Secrets:</strong> Immerse yourself in meticulously crafted levels, where exploration leads to uncovering hidden realms, secret corridors, and immersive lore.</li></ul>",
